If the `MAKEFLAGS=-j4` is commented out, then installation works fine.

This happens because in the Makevars.win, it tries to run `../tools/winlibs.R`, which downloads the openssl files, at the same time as it compiles the code for websocket. By the time it compiles websocket.cpp, it hasn't yet completed downloading the openssl files, and so the error occurs.

Note that if the `windows/` directory exists (because the winlibs.R script has already run), this problem won't happen. To reproduce the problem, remove the windows/ directory, or just do `install_gitub()`.

